<title>UK: BZW sets HSBC HK$10 - HSBC 75p spread warrants.</title>
<headline>BZW sets HSBC HK$10 - HSBC 75p spread warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 25 million European-style warrants on the spread between HSBC HK$10 and HSBC 75p, plus 2.0 stg, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one spread.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    ZERO STG		  ISSUE PRICE  1.14 STG</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   07.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1.12 STG</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  BZEW</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
